title: Yang Ximin's Contract
subtitle: More obstacles in our journey.
tags: events
view-if: year = 1925 and month = 4 and week = 1
max-visits: 1
priority: 2
new-page: true
face-image: img/portraits/YangXimin.jpg
on-arrival: {!
Q.yang_casualties = 0;
Q.nra_casualties = 0;
Q.nra_winyang = 0;
Q.nra_loseyang = 0;
!}

= Yang Ximin's Contract

Yang Ximin, leader of the Yunnan Guest Army in Guangzhou and one of the armies we pay for to protect us has recently upped his prices ten times to use his services against Chen Jiongming.

He is already unreliable in our eyes, and we see fit for us to break ties with him. What do we do now?

- @pay: -6 funds - We have no choice but to pay him off. 
- @refuse: Yang Ximin will leave this instant!

@pay
choose-if: funds >= 6
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough funds.
on-arrival: funds -= 6; nra_strength += 20; nra_militancy -= 0.05;

We have reluctantly payed Yang Ximin for his armies to join ours.

@refuse
face-image: img/portraits/LiuZhenhuan.jpg

We have refused Yang Ximin's offer and have broken ties with him. In retaliation, he rebels against our government and attacks Guangzhou!

Liu Zhenhuan, leader of the Guangxi Guest Army joins him in rebellion.

Chiang Kai-shek has assembled his army to defend against his betrayal, along with Tan Yankai's Hunanese Army and Zhu Peide's Yunnanese Army.

- @battleguangzhou: The outcome is...

@battleguangzhou
on-arrival: {! Q.nra_power = Q.nra_strength * Q.nra_militancy * (1 + Q.nra_experience);
Q.yang_power = Q.yang_strength * Q.yang_militancy * (1 + Q.yang_experience);

Q.nra_casualties = (Q.nra_strength + Q.yang_strength)
    * (Q.yang_power / (Q.nra_power + Q.yang_power)) * 0.1;

Q.yang_casualties = (Q.nra_strength + Q.yang_strength)
    * (Q.nra_power / (Q.nra_power + Q.yang_power)) * 0.1;

Q.nra_vstrength = Math.round(Q.nra_strength*1000);
Q.yang_vstrength = Math.round(Q.yang_strength*1000);

Q.nra_strength -= Q.nra_casualties;
Q.yang_strength -= Q.yang_casualties;

Q.nra_vcasualties = Math.round(Q.nra_casualties*1000);
Q.yang_vcasualties = Math.round(Q.yang_casualties*1000);

if (Q.nra_power > Q.yang_power) {
    Q.nra_experience += 0.1;
    Q.nra_winyang = 1;
} else {
    Q.yang_experience += 0.1;
    Q.nra_loseyang = 1;
}
!}
go-to: yangbattlescreen

@yangbattlescreen

<div>
  <div id="battle_screen">
    <div style="text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #999; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <span style="font-size: 24px;">Battle of Guangzhou</span>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; text-align: center; margin: 20px 30px;">
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div style="color: #10186e;">National Revolutionary Army</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Troops</strong><br>
          [+ nra_vstrength +]
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ nra_vcasualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 20%; font-size: 20px;">VS</div>
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div style="color: #121440;">Guangzhou Protectors</div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <strong>Troops</strong><br>
          [+ yang_vstrength +]
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
          <strong>Casualties</strong><br>
          [+ yang_vcasualties +]
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #999; padding-top: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="font-size: 14px;">OUTCOME</div>
      [? if nra_winyang = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #66BB6A; margin-top: 5px;">National Revolutionary Army Victory</div> ?]
      [? if nra_loseyang = 1 : <div style="font-size: 20px; color: #d42f2f; margin-top: 5px;">Guangzhou Protectors Victory</div> ?]
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

- @winyang: Continue...
- @loseyang: Continue...

@winyang
view-if: nra_winyang = 1

We have easily crushed Yang Ximin's guest army and now he has retreated from Guangdong. It seems our reliance on warlords have reached an end.

@loseyang
view-if: nra_loseyang = 1

Yang Ximin has sacked Guangzhou! Our party members have been forced into exile.

The Communists and Soviets refuse to help us. Yunnan and Guangxi have begun fighting against themselves.

The Guomindang has failed.

- @freeachievig: Congratulations.

@freeachievig
go-to: game_over
